  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.2 - packaging only. Release assemblies no longer embed the build machine's symbol path, so the published package does not disclose the builder's local file system. No functional change from 1.3.1, whose notes follow. 1.3.1 - correctness and privacy fixes following a pre-release audit. Comment reports are now deduplicated per member, rate limited, restricted to visible comments and clamped to the column width, so the report table cannot be flooded or overflowed. Moderation actions are ignored for comments that are not actually in the queue. Account deletion now erases a member's comments when they delete their account through Community Forum, and ICommunityErasureService is callable directly on a site without the forum. The unused stored IP hash is no longer written and is cleared on erasure. Documentation and marketplace metadata corrected throughout. See CHANGELOG.md.",
  "title": "Community Comments for Umbraco",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.3.6",
